invariant: INV-7
file: srv_quic.c
catches: srv_quic_test
reason: the server takes any answer choose_version gives, so a session
  negotiates a version this build derives no keys for and derives its
  Handshake keys under the labels of another. quic_version.h holds every
  version a caller names to quic_version_derived.
  test/srv_quic_version_tests.h requires CH_EIO, internal_error and
  nothing sent for 0, the values beside version 1 and version 2, and a
  reserved version.

--- old
    if (!quic_version_derived(version)) {
        q->hs.alert = ALERT_INTERNAL_ERROR;
        return CH_EIO;
    }
    q->t.quic_negotiated_version = version;
--- new
    q->t.quic_negotiated_version = version;
